      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">By substituting Option 3 (o, m, o, m), the series becomes:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">m n <u>o</u> p <u>m</u> q r | m n <u>o</u> p <u>m</u> q r</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic follows a repeating 7-letter rhythmic block: (m-n-o-p) + (m-q-r).</p>\n",
