      "id": "6d5aa3596fe3-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must be true for the statement to hold and choose the correct option. Statement: Online learning has expanded rapidly, but lack of digital access in rural areas limits its reach, making infrastructure support necessary. Assumptions: I. Internet access affects participation in online learning. II. Infrastructure development can improve digital access. III. All students prefer online education over classroom learning.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must be true for the statement to hold and choose the correct option.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: Online learning has expanded rapidly, but lack of digital access in rural areas limits its reach, making infrastructure support necessary.</p>\n\n<p>Assumptions:</p>\n\n<p>I. Internet access affects participation in online learning.</p>\n\n<p>II. Infrastructure development can improve digital access.</p>\n\n<p>III. All students prefer online education over classroom learning.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I and II are implicit",
          "html": "Only I and II are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II and III are implicit",
          "html": "Only II and III are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "All are implicit",
          "html": "All are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only I is implicit",
          "html": "Only I is implicit"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Internet access affects participation in online learning → <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Implicit </span>(without digital access, online learning cannot reach everyone.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Infrastructure development can improve digital access → <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Implicit</span> (“infrastructure support necessary” assumes that better infrastructure will improve access.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">III. All students prefer online education over classroom learning →  Not Implicit (Suppose <span data-end=\"727\" data-start=\"678\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">many students still prefer classroom learning</span>.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Here, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Only I and II are implicit.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6d5aa3596fe3-q11",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that logically follows. Statement: The office operates from Monday to Friday. Conclusions: I. The office is closed on weekends. II. Employees cannot work overtime.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that logically follows.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: The office operates from Monday to Friday.</p>\n\n<p>Conclusions:</p>\n\n<p>I. The office is closed on weekends.</p>\n\n<p>II. Employees cannot work overtime.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only Conclusion I follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only Conclusion II follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">I. The office is closed on weekends</span> →  <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">True </span>(If the office operates only from Monday to Friday, it implies it does not operate on Saturday and Sunday.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">II. Employees cannot work overtime</span> → <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">False</span> (The statement says nothing about overtime; employees could still work extra hours on working days.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Here, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Only Conclusion I follows.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
