      "id": "6d5aa3596fe3-q20",
      "number": 20,
      "question": "Instruction: Greek letters represent English letters consistently. Based on the codes given, answer the question.If &mu; &omicron; &upsilon; &sigma; &iota; &tau; &eta; is coded as MUSICAL and &theta; &epsilon; &alpha; &tau; &theta; &alpha; &rho; is coded as THEATER, then what does &mu; &theta; &epsilon; &alpha; &tau; represent?",
      "questionHtml": "Instruction: Greek letters represent English letters consistently. Based on the codes given, answer the question.If &mu; &omicron; &upsilon; &sigma; &iota; &tau; &eta; is coded as MUSICAL and &theta; &epsilon; &alpha; &tau;&nbsp;&theta;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&alpha;</span> &rho; is coded as THEATER, then what does &mu; &theta; &epsilon; &alpha; &tau; represent?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "MTHEA",
          "html": "MTHEA"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "MTHET",
          "html": "MTHET"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "MTHEC",
          "html": "MTHEC"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "MTHAE",
          "html": "MTHAE"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>Given:</p>\n\n<p>&mu; &omicron; &upsilon; &sigma; &iota; &kappa; &eta; is coded as MUSICAL</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n <tr>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&mu;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&omicron;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&upsilon;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&sigma;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;&iota;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&tau;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&eta;</span></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>M</td>\n <td>U</td>\n <td>S</td>\n <td>I</td>\n <td>C</td>\n <td>A</td>\n <td>L</td>\n </tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&theta; &epsilon; &alpha;&nbsp;&nbsp;&tau; &epsilon; <span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&rho;</span> is coded as THEATER</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n <tr>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&theta;&nbsp;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&epsilon;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&alpha;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&tau;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&theta;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&alpha;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&rho;</span></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>T</td>\n <td>H</td>\n <td>E</td>\n <td>A</td>\n <td>T</td>\n <td>E</td>\n <td>R</td>\n </tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;&mu; <span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&theta;&nbsp;</span>&epsilon; &alpha; &tau;&nbsp; will be coded as:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n <tr>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;&mu;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&theta;&nbsp;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&epsilon;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&alpha;&nbsp;</span></td>\n <td><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&tau;</span></td>\n </tr>\n <tr>\n <td>M</td>\n <td>T</td>\n <td>H</td>\n <td>E</td>\n <td>A</td>\n </tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Thus,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\"><strong>MTHEA&nbsp;</strong>is the code for<strong> &mu;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\">&theta;&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&epsilon; &alpha; </strong></span><strong>&tau;​</strong><span style=\"color: (33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp; in the given language.</span></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&#39;Option 1&#39;.</strong></p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
