      "id": "6d5aa3596fe3-q21",
      "number": 21,
      "question": "If 7 * 3 = 70 and 5 * 4 = 60, then what is 6 * 5?",
      "questionHtml": "If 7 * 3 = 70 and 5 * 4 = 60, then what is 6 * 5?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "84",
          "html": "84"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "90",
          "html": "90"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "100",
          "html": "100"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "110",
          "html": "110"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Logic: </span><span class=\"base\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span></span><span class=\"base\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span></span><span class=\"base\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span></span><span class=\"base\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span></span><span class=\"base\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ <span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\">84</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 * 5<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> </span></span>will be written as <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">84.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
