      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Average = Left + Right / 2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ Average = 20+40 / 2 = 60 / 2 = <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">30.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, the value of middle is <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">30.</span></p>\n",
